
# SkillConnect AI
## Initial Project Structure Plan

Project Title: SkillConnect AI – An AI-Powered Smart Local Service Marketplace with intelligent Provider Matching 

Technology Stack:
- Frontend: React.js
- Backend: Node.js + Express.js
- Database: PostgresSQL
- AI Integration: Google Gemini API
- Authentication: JWT
- Deployment: Vercel + Render


