## 3. Main System Modules

1. User Authentication Module
   - Customer Registration and Login
   - Service Provider Registration and Login
   - Admin Authentication
   - Role-Based Access

2. Customer Module
   - Customer Profile
   - Search Local Services
   - View Service Providers
   - Book Services
   - Submit Reviews and Ratings

3. Service Provider Module
   - Provider Profile
   - Add and Manage Services
   - Manage Booking Requests
   - View Customer Requests

4. AI Integration Module
   - AI Chatbot Assistant
   - Smart Service Recommendations
   - Customer Requirement Analysis
   - Relevant Provider Suggestions

5. Booking Module
   - Create Booking Requests
   - Accept or Reject Requests
   - Booking Status Management
   - Booking History

6. Admin Module
   - Manage Users
   - Manage Service Providers
   - Manage Service Categories
   - Monitor Bookings
   - Manage Reviews

## 4. Database Collections (PostgresSQL)

- Users
- Services
- Bookings
- Reviews
- Notifications

## 5. Development Phases

Phase 1: Project Setup and Database Connection

Phase 2: User Authentication and Role Management

Phase 3: Customer and Provider Dashboards

Phase 4: Service Listing and Search System

Phase 5: Booking and Review System

Phase 6: AI Chatbot and Recommendation Integration

Phase 7: Admin Dashboard

Phase 8: Testing, Bug Fixing and Deployment


